294:`bench/run.sh` itself was exercised once on the same machine on 2026-11-08 (13:54:19Z to 13:56:28Z, output directed outside the repository): all four stages exited 0, with wall times e2e-browser 14334 ms, e2e-cli 62767 ms, pipeline 38509 ms, portal 12691 ms. Its `run.log`, `run-summary.json` and `machine.txt` are kept under `supplementary/run-sh-verification/` as proof that the orchestration works; no number above comes from that run.
322:## Supplementary static checks (not part of the benchmark)
324:`supplementary/static-checks/` holds logs from an earlier attempt that are not part of this benchmark and are not test evidence: a formatter check (`format.log`), a compile with warnings as errors (`compile.log`), Credo (`credo.log`), Dialyzer (`dialyzer.log`), static source metrics (`metrics.json`, `metrics.log`) and a unit-test run.
325:That unit-test run (`test-run1-default-tmpdir.log`, `test-failed-rerun.log`, `coverage-run1-default-tmpdir.txt`) failed on macOS because the default `TMPDIR` resolves through the `/var -> /private/var` symlink, which the local importer rejects as an unsafe directory (`{:error, :unsafe_directory}` in test setup).
